OL,3,GNEWSAMeeting on maternity services
OL,4,Asuspension
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth bosses responsible for running
OL,7,Fmaternity services in Devon have been
OL,8,Fquestioned about the ongoing suspension
OL,9,Fof the service.
OL,11,FThe maternity unit at North Devon
OL,12,FDistrict Hospital has been closed since
OL,13,F11 August due to staffing problems.
OL,15,FSimon Higginson, chief executive of the
OL,16,FRoyal Devon University Healthcare NHS
OL,17,FFoundation Trust, said the Trust had
OL,18,Fbeen trying to recruit new staff since
OL,19,Flate 2025.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
