OL,3,GNEWSAMeeting on maternity services
OL,4,Asuspension
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust had hoped to reopen maternity
OL,7,Fservices by Tuesday 29 September
OL,8,Fhowever this has been delayed as the
OL,9,Fservice is still not fully staffed.
